# Rover replies for an offline ordinary login to CorePrime Alpha.
# Same map and the same search replies as alpha_features_beta.replay.
# USER_STATUS 1 is an ordinary account: the Locator and QuickPlay are open,
# as to every account, Matchmaking is not offered, and the in-game
# registration form is not offered unless BetaLoginUX was already stored.

# Contact, clearance, then login_confirmed for user id 1.
progress 4 0 0 0
progress 7 0 0 0
progress 8 0 1 0

delay 2
dossier USER_STATUS int 1
dossier LOGINNAME string oa_player
dossier ALLEGIANCE string C

area_name alpha

delay 1
allegiances CCCCIIIAAACCCCCCAAAAAAAAC

